# Prokop VPN kill-switch loader. A file of the prokop package; do not edit.
#
# fw4 includes this file at every firewall start and reload. It loads the
# kill-switch policy Prokop saved (killswitch/runtime.uc), and only while the
# package is installed: a package removal, a downgrade to a release without
# the kill-switch and a sysupgrade to an image without Prokop take this file
# away, and the saved policy is never loaded again. The bracket makes the
# include a wildcard, which is no error while no policy is saved.
include "/etc/prokop/killswitch/policy.nf[t]"
